["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空檔全面壓制：TikTok 花 100 億美元砸出護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是錢和一條暗號：幾年間投入約 100 億美元買量、補貼內容、砸服務器，對手要攔至少得準備 200 到 300 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字節跳動</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊貴的客戶，直到日活破億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推廣預算每個季度增長 100% 以上；Facebook 認定它留存太差、留不住用戶，反而把流量導給它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]